== ui_card "Flash Helper"
  p The <code>ui_flash</code> helper displays temporary notification messages.
  
  h4 Usage
  pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px;"
    code == ui_flash :notice, "Success Message"
    
  h4 Demo
  p Refresh the page or click below to trigger a toast (which uses the same system).
  == ui_button "Trigger Toast", :neutral, onclick: "showToast('Hello from Docs!', 'primary')"
